          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Improved ability to pledge or monetize state‑linked oil assets expands the pool of acceptable collateral for repo and market‑making, lowering transaction costs and increasing bond market liquidity; the reverse (reduced access) tightens liquidity." />
