          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Greater aggregate AI compute enables faster training and deployment of models for vulnerability research, automated spear‑phishing content generation and malware obfuscation, lowering the cost and time-per-attack and thereby raising cyber intrusion rates." />
