          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Greater AI compute capacity enables faster, higher‑fidelity processing of satellite, AIS and ISR sensor feeds and automated anomaly/target detection for US and allied operators, improving attribution and deterrence and lowering the expected rate of hostile maritime incidents." />
