          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Increased compute capacity allows enforcement agencies and financial institutions to run more sophisticated ML models and cross‑source analytics on payments, shipping and trade data, raising detection rates and thereby reducing successful sanctions‑evasion activity." />
