          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A drying of bond market liquidity raises issuance and transaction costs for large project financings, delaying debt closes and construction draws for new data‑centre projects and slowing the build‑out rate." />
