          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Higher bond‑market liquidity lowers collateral and trade‑finance costs for oil traders and tanker operators, enabling timely financing of voyages and commodity rollovers and thereby increasing the volume flow of crude oil shipments; conversely, liquidity drying up reduces shipments." />
